 attacks a second, reach, cone size, the right button, durability, one aside for the ropera, alabarda, shotel and martillo. C7 (UNVERIFIED, not heard or seen): the mod's own weapon sounds (35 recordings in `assets/sound/extra/combat/`, 20 keys `combat.*`: hit, charged hit, miss, charge, guard broken, sweep, lunge, parry, each at the mod's pitch), a slash streak of white specks on every hit and a gold burst on a charged one, and the mod's camera shake (kill, full charge, hit taken, guarded, guard broken, parry; at most 2.4 degrees each, 10 in total). Plan and decisions: [`roadmap/combat.md`](roadmap/combat.md). GPL-3.0 (the mod's). C9 (UNVERIFIED): the mod's HUD: a crosshair that aims, grows, shakes and reddens on a hit, cooldown brackets and bars, the charge bar, guard orbs above the crosshair and a damage vignette / flash (`render/combat_hud.rs`, `assets/combat_hud.rgba`, +20 tests). See `roadmap/combat.md`. C8 (UNVERIFIED): the arcabuz: one item (id 425, 250 uses), hold the special button to reload, press it to light the fuse, then the blast through everything in its cone (`world/combat/arcabuz.rs`, +8 tests). |
+| QoL without a new meter (2026-11-01): gauges, almanac, death pile, craft from a nearby chest, UNVERIFIED, only with the Immersive Pack ON, **NOT b1.7.3** | written without a toolchain: not compiled, not run (+6 tests) | Gauges: the stamina overlay tinted by `biomelife::tint`, marks beside the hearts for heat, cold, a bandage and the hearth (`combat_hud::draw_marks`). Almanac: a held clock shows the day, the season and the minutes to dusk (`biomelife::almanac`). Death pile: a death's drop lasts 20 minutes (`items::PILE_LIFE`) and a red cross marks it on the maps in the bag (`MapData::pin`). Craft from a nearby chest: the recipe book counts and pulls from the chests within 3 blocks of the workbench (`book::pull`, `Inventory::near`). No new meter, no new block. | `roadmap/design.md`, `roadmap/gameplay.md` (42) |
